---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---
<StorefrontLayout title="Returns & Refunds">
  <div class="bg-[#0b1516] min-h-screen py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">Returns & Refunds.</h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#36f4a4] uppercase tracking-widest">Last Updated: October 15, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-[#dae5e6]/70 font-light leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">The 30-Day Window</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">We accept returns on eligible products within exactly 30 days of the delivery date. To initiate a return, contact our support team to acquire a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number. Unauthorized returns sent to our warehouse will be rejected and returned to sender.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">Condition Requirements & Margins</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Because we operate on compressed margins to offer you wholesale pricing, we must strictly enforce condition requirements:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
            <li><strong class="text-white font-medium">Unopened / Factory Sealed:</strong> Eligible for a 100% full refund to the original payment method.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white font-medium">Opened / Used (Undamaged):</strong> Subject to a strict <span class="text-[#36f4a4] font-mono font-bold">15% Restocking Fee</span>. We cannot sell opened electronics as new.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white font-medium">Damaged / Missing Parts:</strong> Rejected. Not eligible for a refund.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">Refund Processing</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Once your return is received at our logistics center, it undergoes a 48-hour hardware inspection. Once cleared, the refund (minus any applicable restocking fees) is immediately transmitted to Stripe. Depending on your bank's clearing cycles, funds will appear in your account within 5-10 business days.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
